:: MP Job Stable Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobStableEncounter to 1>>
马厩外一声长嘶，新到的挽马被装车的号子惊得人立而起，前蹄在半空乱刨，缰绳把木桩勒得咯吱作响。货运车夫扒着车辕催你把最后一捆干草码稳，说再耽搁就赶不上镇口交接的钟点。偏偏檐下那垛干草被夜露浸得发潮，捆绳一勒就往下淌水，马蹄踩上去直打滑。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-stable-enc">
<<mpanimalicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<link "按住惊马 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-stable-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你贴着马颈低声安抚，一把攥住笼头把惊马按回栏边，又顺势替它理开缠在辔头上的草绳。车夫趁势把干草捆甩上车栏，甩手丢给你一份加急装车钱。<span class="green">惊马被稳稳制住，货也按时装齐了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_stable_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 620>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你刚摸到笼头，惊马猛地甩头挣开，后蹄踢翻半垛干草，捆绳散了一地。<span class="red">你被缰绳带得踉跄，只能重新拢马。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回农场 (0:08)|Farmland]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[按住惊马 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "按住惊马">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<link "稳住车辕 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-stable-enc">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你顶住车辕让车夫把干草一层层压紧，又用膝盖抵住轮子防止板车后溜。潮草压得再实也不塌，车夫抹了把汗，按加急趟给你结了脚力钱。<span class="green">板车稳稳装齐，赶在钟点前出了院门。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_stable_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	湿草比看上去沉，你顶到一半脚下打滑，车辕猛地一沉，最上面两捆干草滚进泥里。<span class="red">车夫只得跳下来重新码车。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回农场 (0:08)|Farmland]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[稳住车辕 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "稳住车辕">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link "翻晒干草 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-stable-enc">>
你把受潮的干草一叉叉挑到通风的檐口摊开，又把底层湿草翻上来晾着。车夫见草料松爽了些，脸色缓和下来，没再提工钱的事。<span class="teal">这趟只算搭了把手。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回农场 (0:08)|Farmland]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Trawler Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTrawlerEncounter to 1>>
渔船刚退出外礁，螺旋桨就被一截旧渔网死死缠住，船身随暗涌横摆，机舱里传出闷响。大副盯着正在上涨的潮水，催你在转向彻底失灵前把缠网割净。底舱的鱼箱还空着，他还要赶在涨潮前把最后一网收上来过秤。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-trawler-enc">
<<swimicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 220>><<link "辨潮避涌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-trawler-enc">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你盯住外礁涌线的白沫，趁两次浪头之间的空档把船头绞正，又用长篙顶开贴舷的暗流。大副顺着你指的水色把住舵，船身终于不再横摆，顺手把一份压惊钱塞进你口袋。<span class="green">船在暗涌里重新稳住了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_trawler_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 660>><</if>>
	<<swimmingskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	涌浪比你看的更急，船身猛地一偏，你被甩到船舷边，长篙脱手磕在栏杆上。<span class="red">大副厉声让你先抓住安全绳。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回码头 (0:08)|Docks]]>><<pass 8>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[辨潮避涌 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "辨潮避涌">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<link "割断缠网 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-trawler-enc">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你趴在湿滑的舷板上探身下去，用割网刀贴着轴套一寸寸挑断麻绳，赶在下一个涌头前把缠网整段扯开。螺旋桨重新吃上力，大副把最满的一只鱼箱推到你脚边。<span class="green">轴套转开了，收网还赶得上潮头。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_trawler_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 580>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	刀口在轴套上一滑，只割断半边网结，剩下的麻绳反而绞得更紧。你被船身一带撞在舱壁上，大副黑着脸把刀收了回去。<span class="red">螺旋桨仍卡着，收网只得往后拖。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回码头 (0:08)|Docks]]>><<pass 8>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[割断缠网 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "割断缠网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link "递刀理网 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-trawler-enc">>
你蹲在甲板上把割下来的湿网卷成一捆，又替大副递刀递缆，没敢往船舷外多探半步。潮水漫过跳板前，甲板总算收拾利落，大副只让你先去舱口歇着。<span class="teal">这趟没算船份钱。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回码头 (0:08)|Docks]]>><<pass 8>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>
